WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:02,960
You probably don't mind

2
00:00:04,380 --> 00:00:11,960
This is usually what I say to others.

3
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:14,360
I have the honor to learn from the genius of the country

4
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:16,360
This trip was not in vain

5
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:19,440
Red spring flowers invite battle

6
00:00:22,870 --> 00:00:23,950
Jin Er asks for a fight

7
00:00:24,470 --> 00:00:25,710
I saw it was Li Yi's gang

8
00:00:25,950 --> 00:00:29,400
We respect the strong Lord

9
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:31,340
you have earned our respect

10
00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:34,300
